UDP sensor readings serialized with Protocol Buffers: a client sends a reading and the server decodes and prints it.

Depende
-------

- protobuf-compiler
- python3-protobuf


Generar stubs
-------------

$ protoc -I . --python_out=. sensor.proto


Run server
----------

% ./udp-server.py


Run client
----------

% ./udp-client.py localhost

.
